  "question": {
    "text": "A charge <math><mi>Q</mi></math> is distributed over three concentric spherical shells of radii <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> such that their surface charge densities are equal to one another.<br /><br />The total potential at a point at distance <math><mi>r</mi></math> from their common centre, where <math><mi>r</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math> would be:"
